<title>USA: ASIA PACIFIC AT 3-15/16 IN NEW YORK.</title>
<headline>ASIA PACIFIC AT 3-15/16 IN NEW YORK.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asia Pacific Resources International Holdings Ltd (April) closed at 3-15/16 in New York on Wednesday. It recorded the day's high of 4 and the day's low of 3-15/16.</p>
<p>Volume was 800 shares. Block volume was nil. Its previous close on Tuesday was 4.</p>
<p>April listed 20 million shares of Class A common stock in New York. -- Jakarta newsroom (Tel: 6221-3846364).</p>
